{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "id": "msg_011Ch24StB88xTHut4Jbk96w", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The sweep is not finished, and I did not sign off. The device connection dropped (`BrokenPipeError` on every call, including `open_app` and `screenshot`) partway through, so I could not finish testing or clean up.\n\n**Bug filed (1, confirmed by the developer):**\n- **Subtask parent link lost:** \"Deep sub\" was nested under \"Charge phone\" (3 levels) in the due-date list. After I created and saved a new task \"Probe Nov20\" (due Friday, Nov 20), \"Deep sub\" moved to the top level under \"No due date\". \"Charge phone\" lost its count badge, \"Pack for trip\" went from 3 to 2, and Charge phone's editor lists no subtasks.\n\n**Filed then withdrawn (not reproduced by the developer):** a subtask title saved with a trailing newline. My input method may have caused it, so I'm not treating it as a product bug.\n\n**Checked and working:**\n- Date picker shortcuts follow the Date and time preferences (9 AM / 1 PM / 5 PM / 8 PM, and 7 AM after I changed Morning).\n- Date picker: Today, Tomorrow, Next Sat, Yesterday, Friday, Cancel reverts, OK saves, No time clears the time.\n- Due-date groups: Overdue, Due today, Due tomorrow, Due Friday (6 days out), Due Saturday, November 21 (7 days out), Due Friday, December 4.\n- Grouping by priority, and back to due date.\n- Subtask indentation at three levels, with a roughly constant step (about 52–53 px).\n- Subtask collapse/expand.\n- Repeating task: completing Pay rent moved it to January 4, 2027, and Undo restored December 4.\n- Completing a subtask shows strikethrough and updates the parent count.\n- Rotation to landscape and back kept the data.\n\n**Not tested:** sort options other than grouping, notes/link handling on Read docs, completing parent tasks, and rows with both start and due dates.\n\n**Data I changed (needs your review):**\n- Morning preference changed from 9 AM to **7 AM**. Please set it back to 9 AM under Settings → Date and time.\n- Buy milk: due Thursday Nov 19 → **Saturday Nov 21, 5 PM**.\n- Pack for trip: due Tuesday Nov 24 → **Tomorrow (Nov 15), no time**.\n- Pay rent: completed then undone, back to Friday Dec 4 (verified).\n- Test tasks left in the list: \"Probe overdue\", \"Probe today\" (due today 5 PM, start date \"Day before due\"), \"Probe Nov20\", \"Probe plain\", plus the \"Deep sub\" subtask under Charge phone. I did not delete them.\n\nOnce the device is reachable again, the next steps are to revert the Morning preference and delete the test tasks, then finish the untested areas above."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 463, "cache_read_input_tokens": 444740, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 463}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "b27329b4-0825-4a08-933f-4414ed311191", "uuid": "c656bb71-d201-45f8-a28b-17050164a9a1", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T02:50:13.543Z", "request_id": "req_011Ch24Ss6PcNYUMcmTwv4TG"}
